        <h1>Google Ads for HVAC Companies: Campaign Structure, Keywords and Better Leads</h1>
        <p class="lf-lede">Successful HVAC Google Ads campaigns connect service-specific search intent to the right landing page, filter irrelevant traffic and measure the quality of booked work—not just the number of clicks.</p>
