        <strong>THE SHORT ANSWER</strong>
        <p>Successful HVAC Google Ads campaigns connect service-specific search intent to the right landing page, filter irrelevant traffic and measure the quality of booked work—not just the number of clicks.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hv-article-cta">
